The driver of the pinned commit fails with an exception at two places.
`PathLengthSampler.kill` fails when the last measurement was a time-out, as the time-out leaves no process.
`get_pump_report` takes five values from a profile of four values, so it fails for every pattern whose pumping ends
without a time-out and without a class that stops it early.
`pump_all.py` of the artifact of the paper (10.5281/zenodo.5669243) takes four values there.

